    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tomochi is a short adventure RPG where you play as a young kid on a journey to leave your hometown. Sounds easy, doesn't it? If it weren't for the strange and spiteful creatures lingering around every corner that you pass!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn based battle against different creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High difficulty</strong> but rewarding once you learn the behaviour of the creatures!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attacks come in form of mini games (e.g. bullet hell)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creatures can be caught to obtain a bonus in battles</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tomochi is a short adventure RPG where you play as a young kid on a journey to leave your hometown. Sounds easy, doesn't it? If it weren't for the strange and spiteful creatures lingering around every corner that you pass!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn based battle against different creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High difficulty</strong> but rewarding once you learn the behaviour of the creatures!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attacks come in form of mini games (e.g. bullet hell)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creatures can be caught to obtain a bonus in battles</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Tomochi is a difficult game about fighting and collecting creatures. Be prepared for a challenge!",
